        {
          "text": "I proposed the payment for INV-102. No money has moved yet because a person still has to approve it.\n\n**Proposed: PAY-001**\n- **Invoice:** INV-102 from Contoso Grid Services, for October grid maintenance, due 2026-11-20\n- **Amount:** 8400.00 USDC, which is exactly the invoice amount\n- **Paid to:** Contoso's registered payout address, 0x52643A794E3Ea74898a4564Cb588079b5c480A93\n\n**Checks:**\n- The invoice is open and there was no earlier payment for it.\n- Contoso is an active vendor.\n- The treasury has 100,000.00 USDC, so the balance covers it.\n- The vendor's message was just an ordinary note with the invoice. It didn't ask for a different address or anything else unusual.\n\n**Next step:** Someone needs to approve PAY-001 before the money is sent.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
